 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Parent RAG para \"Os Sertões\" - Euclides da Cunha\n",
    "\n",
    "Este notebook implementa uma abordagem **Parent Document Retrieval** (Parent RAG) para responder perguntas sobre o livro \"Os Sertões\".\n",
    "\n",
    "## Diferença do Naive RAG:\n",
    "- **Naive RAG**: Chunks pequenos (ex: 1000 chars) - pode perder contexto\n",
    "- **Parent RAG**: Documentos pais grandes + chunks filhos pequenos\n",
    "  - Indexa chunks filhos (para busca precisa)\n",
    "  - Retorna documentos pais completos (para contexto rico)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Vantagens:\n",
    "1. Busca precisa nos chunks pequenos\n",
    "2. Contexto completo do documento pai na geração\n",
    "3. Melhor para documentos longos e estruturados como livros"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Instalação de dependências\n",
    "!pip install -q pypdf sentence-transformers faiss-cpu langchain-openai langchain-community langchain-text-splitters tiktoken python-dotenv tqdm langchain"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import requests\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "# Download do PDF (se não existir)\n",
    "pdf_url = \"https://fundar.org.br/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/os-sertoes.pdf\"\n",
    "pdf_path = Path(\"os-sertoes.pdf\")\n",
    "\n",
    "if not pdf_path.exists():\n",
    "    print(\"Baixando PDF...\")\n",
    "    response = requests.get(pdf_url, stream=True)\n",
    "    response.raise_for_status()\n",
    "    with open(pdf_path, \"wb\") as f:\n",
    "        for chunk in response.iter_content(chunk_size=8192):\n",
    "            f.write(chunk)\n",
    "    print(f\"PDF salvo em: {pdf_path.absolute()}\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"PDF já existe em: {pdf_path.absolute()}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Extração de texto do PDF com metadados de página\n",
    "from pypdf import PdfReader\n",
    "\n",
    "reader = PdfReader(\"os-sertoes.pdf\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Criar documentos por página (cada página = um documento pai)\n",
    "parent_documents = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n",
    "    text = page.extract_text()\n",
    "    if text and text.strip():\n",
    "        parent_documents.append({\n",
    "            \"page_number\": i + 1,\n",
    "            \"content\": text,\n",
    "            \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"os-sertoes.pdf\", \"page\": i + 1}\n",
    "        })\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Total de documentos pai (páginas): {len(parent_documents)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Exemplo - Página 1: {parent_documents[0]['content'][:200]}...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Criar chunks filhos (child chunks) para cada documento pai\n",
    "from langchain_text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n",
    "\n",
    "child_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n",
    "    chunk_size=400,  # Chunks menores para busca precisa\n",
    "    chunk_overlap=50,\n",
    "    length_function=len,\n",
    "    separators=[\"\\n\\n\", \"\\n\", \". \", \" \", \"\"]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "child_chunks = []\n",
    "child_to_parent = []  # Mapeamento: índice do chunk -> índice do documento pai\n",
    "\n",
    "for parent_idx, parent_doc in enumerate(parent_documents):\n",
    "    chunks = child_splitter.split_text(parent_doc[\"content\"])\n",
    "    for chunk in chunks:\n",
    "        child_chunks.append(chunk)\n",
    "        child_to_parent.append(parent_idx)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Total de chunks filhos: {len(child_chunks)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Média de chunks por página: {len(child_chunks) / len(parent_documents):.1f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Geração de embeddings para chunks filhos\n",
    "from sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "model = SentenceTransformer('sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Gerando embeddings dos chunks filhos...\")\n",
    "child_embeddings = model.encode(child_chunks, show_progress_bar=True, batch_size=32)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Shape: {child_embeddings.shape}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Vector Store FAISS para chunks filhos\n",
    "import faiss\n",
    "\n",
    "dimension = child_embeddings.shape[1]\n",
    "child_index = faiss.IndexFlatIP(dimension)\n",
    "\n",
    "faiss.normalize_L2(child_embeddings)\n",
    "child_index.add(child_embeddings.astype('float32'))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Índice de chunks filhos: {child_index.ntotal} vetores\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Salvar tudo\n",
    "faiss.write_index(child_index, \"parent_rag_child_index.faiss\")\n",
    "import pickle\n",
    "with open(\"parent_rag_parent_docs.pkl\", \"wb\") as f:\n",
    "    pickle.dump(parent_documents, f)\n",
    "with open(\"parent_rag_child_chunks.pkl\", \"wb\") as f:\n",
    "    pickle.dump(child_chunks, f)\n",
    "with open(\"parent_rag_child_to_parent.pkl\", \"wb\") as f:\n",
    "    pickle.dump(child_to_parent, f)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Dados do Parent RAG salvos.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Função de busca Parent RAG\n",
    "def parent_retrieve(query, k=5, parent_k=3):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Busca Parent RAG:\n",
    "    1. Busca top-k chunks filhos mais similares\n",
    "    2. Identifica os documentos pais únicos\n",
    "    "3. Retorna top-parent_k documentos pais completos\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    # 1. Busca nos chunks filhos\n",
    "    query_embedding = model.encode([query])\n",
    "    faiss.normalize_L2(query_embedding)\n",
    "    scores, indices = child_index.search(query_embedding.astype('float32'), k)\n",
    "    \n    " # 2. Coletar documentos pais únicos com melhor score\n",
    "    parent_scores = {}\n",
    "    for score, child_idx in zip(scores[0], indices[0]):\n",
    "        if child_idx < len(child_to_parent):\n",
    "            parent_idx = child_to_parent[child_idx]\n",
    "            if parent_idx not in parent_scores or score > parent_scores[parent_idx]:\n",
    "                parent_scores[parent_idx] = float(score)\n",
    "    \n    " # 3. Ordenar e retornar top parent_k documentos pais\n",
    "    sorted_parents = sorted(parent_scores.items(), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)\n",
    "    \n    " results = []\n",
    "    for parent_idx, score in sorted_parents[:parent_k]:\n",
    "        parent_doc = parent_documents[parent_idx]\n",
    "        results.append({\n",
    "            \"parent_doc\": parent_doc,\n",
    "            \"score\": score,\n",
    "            \"parent_index\": parent_idx\n",
    "        })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return results\n",
    "\n",
    "# Teste\n",
    "test_query = \"visão de Euclides da Cunha sobre o sertão\"\n",
    "results = parent_retrieve(test_query, k=10, parent_k=3)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, r in enumerate(results):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n--- Pai {i+1} (Página {r['parent_doc']['page_number']}, score: {r['score']:.4f}) ---\")\n",
    "    print(r['parent_doc']['content'][:300] + \"...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Configuração do LLM\n",
    "from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\n",
    "from langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate\n",
    "from langchain_core.output_parsers import StrOutputParser\n",
    "\n",
    "llm = ChatOpenAI(model=\"gpt-4o-mini\", temperature=0.1)\n",
    "\n",
    "prompt_template = ChatPromptTemplate.from_template(\"\"\"\n",
    "Você é um especialista na obra \"Os Sertões\" de Euclides da Cunha.\n",
    "Responda à pergunta baseando-se APENAS no contexto fornecido abaixo.\n",
    "O contexto contém páginas completas do livro para melhor compreensão.\n",
    "Se a informação não estiver no contexto, diga que não encontrou a informação.\n",
    "\n",
    "Contexto (páginas do livro):\n",
    "{context}\n",
    "\n",
    "Pergunta: {question}\n",
    "\n",
    "Resposta:\n",
    "\"\"\")\n",
    "\n",
    "chain = prompt_template | llm | StrOutputParser()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Pipeline completo Parent RAG\n",
    "def parent_rag(question, k=10, parent_k=3):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Pipeline completo Parent RAG.\"\"\"\n",
    "    # Retrieval: busca chunks filhos, retorna documentos pais\n",
    "    results = parent_retrieve(question, k=k, parent_k=parent_k)\n",
    "    \n    " # Contexto = documentos pais completos\n",
    "    context = \"\\n\\n\".join([\n",
    "        f\"--- PÁGINA {r['parent_doc']['page_number']} ---\\n{r['parent_doc']['content']}\"\n",
    "        for r in results\n",
    "    ])\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Generation\n",
    "    answer = chain.invoke({\n",
    "        \"context\": context,\n",
    "        \"question\": question\n",
    "    })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return {\n",
    "        \"answer\": answer,\n",
    "        \"sources\": results\n",
    "    }"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Perguntas do desafio\n",
    "questions = [\n",
    "    \"Qual é a visão de Euclides da Cunha sobre o ambiente natural do sertão nordestino e como ele influencia a vida dos habitantes?\",\n",
    "    \"Quais são as principais características da população sertaneja descritas por Euclides da Cunha? Como ele relaciona essas características com o ambiente em que vivem?\",\n",
    "    \"Qual foi o contexto histórico e político que levou à Guerra de Canudos, segundo Euclides da Cunha?\",\n",
    "    \"Como Euclides da Cunha descreve a figura de Antônio Conselheiro e seu papel na Guerra de Canudos?\",\n",
    "    \"Quais são os principais aspectos da crítica social e política presentes em \\\"Os Sertões\\\"? Como esses aspectos refletem a visão do autor sobre o Brasil da época?\"\n",
    "]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Executar Parent RAG para todas as perguntas\n",
    "results = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, q in enumerate(questions, 1):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n{'='*80}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"PERGUNTA {i}: {q}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"{'='*80}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    result = parent_rag(q, k=10, parent_k=3)\n",
    "    results[f\"q{i}\"] = result\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"\\nRESPOSTA:\\n{result['answer']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"\\nFONTES ({len(result['sources'])} páginas):\")\n",
    "    for j, src in enumerate(result['sources']):\n",
    "        print(f\"  {j+1}. Página {src['parent_doc']['page_number']} - Score: {src['score']:.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Salvar resultados\n",
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "output = {}\n",
    "for key, val in results.items():\n",
    "    output[key] = {\n",
    "        \"question\": questions[int(key[1])-1],\n",
    "        \"answer\": val[\"answer\"],\n",
    "        \"sources\": [\n",
    "            {\"page\": s[\"parent_doc\"][\"page_number\"], \"score\": s[\"score\"]}\n",
    "            for s in val[\"sources\"]\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "\n",
    "with open(\"parent_rag_results.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n",
    "    json.dump(output, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Resultados salvos em parent_rag_results.json\")"
   ]
  }
 ],
